  "description": "An 8 m 4x4 truck on a ladder of six beams: a diesel (its battery turns the starter), an automatic gearbox and a transfer case in 4WD (the linking tool's R: 2WD). Right-angle gearboxes take the shafts down onto a locked live axle at the back and an open wide axle at the front, whose wheels are driven through CV joints into their steering pivots. Leaf springs, large wheels, a tow hitch.",
